### [#](#beforetooltipdraw) beforeTooltipDraw

▸ `Optional` **beforeTooltipDraw**(`chart`, `args`, `options`): `boolean` | `void`

**`Desc`**

Called before drawing the `tooltip`. If any plugin returns `false`,
the tooltip drawing is cancelled until another `render` is triggered.

#### [#](#parameters-2) Parameters

| Name | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `chart` | [`Chart`](/docs/latest/api/classes/Chart.html)<keyof [`ChartTypeRegistry`](/docs/latest/api/interfaces/ChartTypeRegistry.html), (`number` | [`number`, `number`] | [`Point`](/docs/latest/api/interfaces/Point.html) | [`BubbleDataPoint`](/docs/latest/api/interfaces/BubbleDataPoint.html))[], `unknown`> | The chart instance. |
| `args` | `Object` | The call arguments. |
| `args.cancelable` | `true` | - |
| `args.tooltip` | `Model` | The tooltip. |
| `options` | `O` | The plugin options. |

#### [#](#returns-2) Returns

`boolean` | `void`

`false` to cancel the chart tooltip drawing.

